# Prompting

## Do

- Keep instructions short and clear


### Images
- Describe the image only, what is in it, how it looks, style and so on, without the purpuse you are going to use it for. 

## Donts

- Avoid negative prompts, it backfires, making the llm do the thing you don't want.
- Avoid examples, as the cheaper llms tend to latch on to those examples and use them frequently.